WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

00:00.000 --> 00:02.080
The Jacaranda Corner. Golden hour under a jacaranda tree: Lina crouches among fallen purple blossom with a magnifying glass, a lantern glowing by the stone wall.

00:02.080 --> 00:03.170
Curious delight. Close-up: Lina peers through the magnifying glass, her eye huge in the lens, smiling.

00:03.170 --> 00:05.790
Through the lens. A ladybird crawls across a felted blossom.

00:05.790 --> 00:06.830
Unnoticed. Among the roots, a golden felt ball with a stitched smile trembles loose.

00:06.830 --> 00:08.210
The ball looms. Through the lens, the ball’s smiling face fills the glass.

00:08.210 --> 00:09.460
Alarm. Lina’s delight turns to alarm.

00:09.460 --> 00:11.000
Scramble. Lina scrambles back under the tree as the ball rolls towards her.

00:11.000 --> 00:11.880
Stopped short. Low angle: the ball stops short in front of her.

00:11.880 --> 00:13.580
At the window. Her father jolts upright at the window and leans out: “What’s happening?”

00:13.580 --> 00:15.070
Harmless. Over her shoulder, the ball sits harmlessly beside the magnifying glass, and Lina laughs.
